000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.     TDSCMAIN.
000400 AUTHOR.         DAVID A. PLUM, JR.
000500 DATE-WRITTEN.   MAY 1985.
000600 DATE-COMPILED.
000700 INSTALLATION.   THE GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER COMPANY - AKRON.
000800*REMARKS.
000900*C************************************************************
001000*C                                                           *
001100*C  T D S C M A I N      CODE/DESCRIPTION MAIN PROGRAM       *
001200*C                                                           *
001300*C  THIS PROGRAM IS THE MAIN PROGRAM FOR CODE/DESCRIPTION    *
001400*C  MAINTENANCE PERMITTED WITHIN THE HP ENVIRONMENT.         *
001500*C                                                           *
001600*C  SUBPROGRAMS CALLED:                                      *
001700*C                                                           *
001800*C    1) SKWMUPDT - KEYWORD/MODIFIER UPDATE SUBPROGRAM       *
001900*C    2) SMFRUPDT - MANUFACTURER UPDATE SUBPROGRAM           *
002000*C    3) SCODEUPD - CODE UPDATE SUBPROGRAM                   *
002100*C    4) SDSCINQ  - DESCRIPTION INQUIRY SUBPROGRAM           *
002200*C    5) TSCRPRT2 - SCREEN PRINT SUBPROGRAM                  *
002300*C    6) TBLOWUP  - BLOWUP SUBPROGRAM                        *
002400*C                                                           *
002500*C************************************************************
002600*C  PROGRAM CHANGES:                                         *
002700*C                                                           *
002800*C  09/19/85  ADDED CALLS TO FINDJCW, NLAPPEND, CATOPEN, AND *
002900*C            CATCLOSE IN ORDER TO ACCOMODATE THE NATIVE     *
003000*C            LANGUAGE SUPPORT FACILITY.  ADDED LINKAGES AND *
003100*C            ALSO MADE THE CHANGE TO THE FORMFILE NAMES.    *
003200*C                                     -T W COTTON           *
003300*C                                                           *
003400*C  02/04/86  ADDED MPLTINFO IN ORDER TO VALIDATE PLANT      *
003500*C            INFO. BEFORE CALLING THE SUBROUTINES.          *
003600*C                                     -A M KRAUSS           *
003700*C                                                           *
003800*C  07/15/86  ADDED A CHECK WHICH PREVENTS THE DOMESTIC AND  *
003900*C            CANADIAN PLANTS FROM PERFORMING THE KWM, MFR,  *
004000*C            AND CODING FUNCTIONS.  THE PLANTS WHICH CANNOT *
004100*C            USE THESE FUNCTIONS ARE LISTED IN THE COPYLIB  *
004200*C            MEMBER PLANTS UNDER THE 88 LEVEL ENTRY         *
004300*C            NO-PLANT-CODES-PLANT.    -D.A. PLUM            *
004400*C                                                           *
004500*C  11/21/86  CHANGED REFERENCES TO FORMFILE FDSCINQ TO      *
004600*C            FCSISINQ.  FDSCINQ IS BEING ELIMINATED.        *
004700*C                                     -D.A. PLUM            *
      *C                                                           *
      *C  07/28/95  ADDED CARTERSVILLE TO LIST OF PLANTS.          *
      *C                                     -C.A. YODER           *
      *C                                                           *
      *C  12APR1997     DAVE PLUM                                  *
      *C    RECOMPILED TO PICK REVISED "PLANTS" COPYLIB MEMBER.    *
      *C                                                           *
      *C  19DEC1997     DAVE PLUM                                  *
      *C    RECOMPILED TO PICK REVISED "PLANTS" COPYLIB MEMBER.    *
      *C                                                           *
004800*C************************************************************
004900
005000 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
005100 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
005200 SOURCE-COMPUTER.  AS400.
005300 OBJECT-COMPUTER.  AS400.
       SPECIAL-NAMES. I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.
005400 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
005500 FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT PLANT-FILE    ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCPLTCODES.
           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
                  ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZDSCMAIN-SI
                  ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
                  ACCESS IS SEQUENTIAL
                  FILE STATUS IS DISPLAY-STATUS
                  CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.

           SELECT MPLTINFO-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0501
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
005700
005800 DATA DIVISION.
005900 FILE SECTION.
       FD  DISPLAY-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  DISPLAY-REC                            PIC X(2000).

       FD  MPLTINFO-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MPLTINFO-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS  OF MCFLCS0501.

006000*************************************************************
006100**       THIS FILE CONTAINS PLANT SIGN-ON AND              **
006200**       COMPANY CODE FOR PLANTS RUNNING CSIS              **
006300**       WITH MULTIPLE DATABASES.                          **
006400*************************************************************
006500 COPY PLTCODES   IN COPYLIB.
006600
006700 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
006800 77  PASSED-SPOOL-PRT           PIC S9(2) COMP VALUE 0.

       COPY CATREAD IN COPYLIB.

       COPY CPYIND  IN COPYLIB.

007000 01  DB-SUB                     PIC 9(1)  VALUE 0.

       01  DISPLAY-STATUS             PIC XX.

       01  FIELD-NUMBER               PIC S9(4) COMP-4.

       01  FILE-STATUS                PIC XX.

       COPY IOFEEDBACK IN COPYLIB.

011600 01  MESSAGE-BUFFER.
011700     05  MSG-TEXT               PIC X(64)  VALUE SPACES.
011800     05  MSG-FLD                PIC X(12)  VALUE SPACES.
011900     05  MSG-FLD-9 REDEFINES MSG-FLD
                                      PIC Z(11)9.
012100
007100 01  MPLTINFO-PARMS.
007200     05  PLANT-CODE             PIC X(3)  VALUE SPACES.
007300     05  DDESC-LANG             PIC X(3)  VALUE SPACES.
007400     05  DDESC2-LANG            PIC X(3)  VALUE SPACES.

006900 01  MULTIPLE-DB-PLANT          PIC X(1)  VALUE "N".
007500
007600 COPY PLTBASES   IN COPYLIB.
007700
007800 COPY PLANTS     IN COPYLIB.
007900
       01  SCREEN-BUFFER.
           05  SCREEN-CMD-LINE        PIC X(79).
           05  SCREEN-ERR-LINE        PIC X(79).

008000*************************************************************
008100*************************************************************
008200**                                                         **
008300**              D A T A    B A S E    A R E A              **
008400**                                                         **
008500*************************************************************
008600*************************************************************
008700
008800 01  BASE                       PIC X(10)  VALUE "  STORES;".
008900 01  PASSWORD                   PIC X(5)   VALUE "JADE;".
009000 01  DSET-NAME                  PIC X(16)  VALUE SPACES.
009100
009200 COPY DBMODES    IN COPYLIB.
009300
009400 COPY DBSTAT     IN COPYLIB.
009500
010500 COPY MPLTINFO   IN COPYLIB.
011000
009600 01 SEARCH-ITEMS.
009700     05  ALL-ITEMS              PIC X(2)  VALUE "@;".
009800
011100 COPY VCOMAREA   IN COPYLIB.

013800*************************************************************
013900*************************************************************
014000**                                                         **
014100**                 COMMUNICATIONS AREAS                    **
014200**                                                         **
014300*************************************************************
014400*************************************************************
016600 COPY LANGUAGE   IN COPYLIB.
016700
016800 COPY TBLOWUP    IN COPYLIB.
016900
       COPY WSCONTROL  IN COPYLIB.
017000*************************************************************
017100**#########################################################**
017200*************************************************************
017300**                                                         **
017400**          P R O C E D U R E    D I V I S I O N           **
017500**                                                         **
017600*************************************************************
017700**#########################################################**
017800*************************************************************
017900
018000 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
018100
018200 MAIN-PGM SECTION.
018300
018400 BEGIN-HERE.
018500     PERFORM 1-HSK  THRU 1-HSK-X.
018600     PERFORM 6-MAIN THRU 6-MAIN-X.
018700     CLOSE MPLTINFO-I, DISPLAY-FILE.
018800     GOBACK.
018900
019000 1-HSK.
           OPEN I-O   DISPLAY-FILE.
           OPEN INPUT MPLTINFO-I.
019100     MOVE "TDSCMAIN" TO BU-PGM-NAME.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
023100     MOVE "P 01" TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-REC-I.
023200     READ MPLTINFO-I INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
023300         INVALID KEY    MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD.
023400     IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00" MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD.
023500     IF COND-WORD NOT = 0
023600         MOVE "GET MPLTINFO COMPANY ERROR IN 1-HSK"
023700             TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
023800         MOVE "MPLTINFO KEY= "     TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
023900         MOVE "P 01"               TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
024000         PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.
024100
024200     MOVE MPLTINFO-COMPANY TO PLANT-CODE,
024300                              WHICH-PLANT.
024400
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
024500     MOVE "PLAN" TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-REC-I.
           READ MPLTINFO-I INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY    MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00" MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD.
024900     IF COND-WORD NOT = 0
025000         MOVE "GET MPLTINFO LANGUAGES ERROR IN 1-HSK"
025100             TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
025200         MOVE "MPLTINFO KEY= "     TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
025300         MOVE "PLAN"               TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
025400         PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.
025500
025600     MOVE PRIMARY-LANGUAGE    TO DDESC-LANG.
025700     MOVE SECONDARY-LANGUAGE  TO DDESC2-LANG.
025800
025900     PERFORM 110-READ-PLANT-FILE THRU 199-EXIT.
026000
026100 1-HSK-X.
026200     EXIT.
026300
026400**********************************
026500**  IF MULTI DB PLANT, READ IN  **
026600**  THE PLANT ID'S AND CODES.   **
026700**********************************
026800 110-READ-PLANT-FILE.
026900     MOVE SPACES                   TO BASE-AREA.
027000     MOVE 1                        TO DB-SUB.
027100     OPEN INPUT PLANT-FILE.
027200
027300 111-MULTIDB-READ.
027400     READ PLANT-FILE AT END
027500         CLOSE PLANT-FILE
027600         GO TO 112-CHECK-HOW-MANY.
027700
027800     MOVE PLANT-ID                 TO  BASE-PLT      (DB-SUB).
027900     MOVE PLANT-HOMEGRP2           TO  BASE-GROUP    (DB-SUB).
028000     MOVE "  STORES."              TO  BASE-NAME     (DB-SUB).
028100     MOVE PLANT-LDESC              TO  BASE-PLT-DESC (DB-SUB).
028200     ADD  1                        TO  DB-SUB.
028300     GO TO 111-MULTIDB-READ.
028400
028500 112-CHECK-HOW-MANY.
028600     IF DB-SUB  -  1 > 1
028700         MOVE "Y"                  TO  MULTIPLE-DB-PLANT.
028800
028900 199-EXIT.
029000     EXIT.
029100
031300******************************************************
031400**                 BLOWUP ROUTINE                   **
031500******************************************************
031600
031700 2-BLOWUP.
031800     CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
031900           VIEW-COMAREA, DUMMY-KSAM-STAT, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
032000           BU-DISPLAY-AREA.
032100
034100 4-VIEW-ERROR.
           MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO SCREEN-ERR-LINE.
           MOVE B"1" TO INDS(FIELD-NUMBER), INDS(99).
036200 4-VIEW-ERROR-X.
036300     EXIT.
036400
036500**************************************************
036600*                                                *
036700*                  6 - M A I N                   *
036800*                                                *
036900**************************************************
037000
037100 6-MAIN.
           MOVE SCREEN-BUFFER TO DISPLAY-REC.
037200     MOVE "MAINMENU" TO VIEW-NFNAME.
037300     PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN THRU 998-READ-SCREEN.
           MOVE DISPLAY-REC TO SCREEN-BUFFER.
           MOVE SPACES TO SCREEN-BUFFER.
040200
040300     IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 3
040400         GO TO 6-MAIN-X.
040500
040700     IF (VIEW-LASTKEY = 1 OR 2 OR 8) AND (NO-PLANT-CODES-PLANT)
040800****     THIS FUNCTION IS NOT AVAILABLE AT THIS PLANT    ****
040900         MOVE  20  TO LANG-SETNUM
041000         MOVE  34  TO LANG-MSGNUM
041100         PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE 99 TO FIELD-NUMBER
041200         PERFORM 4-VIEW-ERROR THRU 4-VIEW-ERROR-X
041400     ELSE
041500     IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 1
041600         CALL "SKWMUPDT"  USING BASE,
041700                                VIEW-COMAREA,
041800                                LANGUAGE-PARMS,
041900                                MPLTINFO-PARMS
042000*                               MULTIPLE-DB-PLANT,
042100*                               BASE-AREA
042200     ELSE
042300     IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 2
042400         CALL "SMFRUPDT"  USING BASE,
042500                                VIEW-COMAREA,
042600                                LANGUAGE-PARMS,
042700                                MPLTINFO-PARMS
042800     ELSE
043700     IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 4
043800         PERFORM 61-INQUIRY THRU 61-INQUIRY-X
043900     ELSE
042900     IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 8
043000         CALL "SCODEUPD" USING BASE,
043100                               VIEW-COMAREA,
043200                               LANGUAGE-PARMS,
043300                               MPLTINFO-PARMS,
043400                               MULTIPLE-DB-PLANT,
043500                               BASE-AREA
043600     ELSE
044400***      INVALID FUNCTION KEY      ***
044500         MOVE   9 TO LANG-SETNUM
044600         MOVE  10 TO LANG-MSGNUM
044700         PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE 99 TO FIELD-NUMBER
044800         PERFORM 4-VIEW-ERROR THRU 4-VIEW-ERROR-X.
045000
045100     GO TO 6-MAIN.
045200
045300 6-MAIN-X.
045400     EXIT.
045500
045600 61-INQUIRY.
047400     CALL "SDSCINQ" USING BASE,
047500                          VIEW-COMAREA,
047600                          LANGUAGE-PARMS,
047700                          MPLTINFO-PARMS.
047800
049600 61-INQUIRY-X.
049700     EXIT.
049800
       998-WRITE-SCREEN.
           WRITE DISPLAY-REC FORMAT IS VIEW-NFNAME
               INDIC IS INDICS.
           MOVE ALL B"0" TO INDICS.

       998-READ-SCREEN.
           READ DISPLAY-FILE FORMAT IS VIEW-NFNAME
               INDIC IS INDICS.
           ACCEPT IOFEEDBACK FROM I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.
           MOVE ALL B"0" TO INDICS.
           IF DISPLAY-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE 3 TO VIEW-LASTKEY
           ELSE
           MOVE FUNCTION-NUM TO VIEW-LASTKEY.

049900 999-CATREAD.
           IF CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER = ZEROS
               MOVE LANG-SETNUM TO CATREAD-MSG-SET
               MOVE LANG-MSGNUM TO CATREAD-MSG-NUM.
           CALL "CCATREAD" USING CATREAD-PARMS.
           MOVE CATREAD-MSG-TEXT TO MESSAGE-BUFFER.
051700 999-CATREAD-EXIT.    EXIT.
